id: pm-um3teu
title: Automatically bound high-frequency read-only telemetry volume
description: "GitHub report https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1241. Read-only commands support bounded sampling with explicit inclusion probability on both lifecycle events; mutating commands and errors remain unsampled; controls are documented and tested through the SDK."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags: []
created_at: "2026-09-12T21:08:21.753Z"
updated_at: "2026-09-14T13:52:04.964Z"
closed_at: "2026-09-14T13:52:03.804Z"
completed_at: "2026-09-14T13:52:03.804Z"
author: "harness:codex"
acceptance_criteria: Default repeated core read invocations are automatically bounded without requiring users to discover an opt-in variable; eligibility proves read ownership rather than assuming a command name; failures and writes remain fully retained; weighting and bounded cross-process state are validated.
goal: project management = context management
objective: Bound read-only telemetry volume with paired weighted sampling
value: Reliable privacy-preserving operational context for agents and package consumers
parent: pm-5oj5
resolution: SDK-owned core-read ownership proof and bounded per-minute installation counters automatically sample successful pairs while retaining failures and mutations
expected_result: Automatic repeated-read volume reduction with complete retained lifecycle pairs and explicit weighting
actual_result: "Node 22 and current-runtime suites pass; real multiprocess ordinal checks, public SDK npm/Bun consumers, npx/bunx smoke and 8871 full-suite tests pass at exact 100/100/100/100 coverage"
